Package: nuvio-linux
Version: __VERSION__
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: mpv
Maintainer: JJDizz1L <jjdizz1l@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/JJDizz1L/NuvioLinux
Description: Nuvio Linux desktop media player
 Nuvio Linux is a desktop media client for browsing metadata, managing
 collections and watch progress, downloading media, and playing streams from
 user-installed extensions or user-provided sources. It is a hard fork of
 Nuvio Desktop with a native Linux playback stack powered by mpv
 (hardware-accelerated decoding via VAAPI/NVDEC).
